flowchart TB
  BASE[Base task: user goal + tools + ground truth]
  BASE --> CLEAN[Clean condition]
  BASE --> INTERV[Intervention condition]
  INTERV --> PATCH[Single-factor patch]
  PATCH --> FAM[Family: tool_failure / memory / ...]
  CLEAN --> GOAL[Goal preserved]
  INTERV --> GOAL
  CLEAN --> SCORE_C[Score: expected answer]
  INTERV --> SCORE_I[Score: expected robust behavior]
